### Liste les transactions d'un compte
GET {{endpoint}}/transactions?accountId=ID_DU_COMPTE
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crée une transaction
POST {{endpoint}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "accountId": "01M8C4RJP0SERZMMSJSSKFMRTZ",
  "amountCents": 234,
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "date": "2026-09-16T12:00:00Z"
}

### Stream des transactions (SSE)
GET {{endpoint}}/transactions/stream?accountId=ID_DU_COMPTE
Accept: text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
